{"id":292,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"両立型で学ぶ日大第一中高一貫校","feature_description":"日本大学の付属校として、勉強も部活も本気で取り組む「両立型」教育を掲げています。学校生活や部活動レポート、説明会情報が充実しており、進路まで伴走する姿勢が伝わる構成です。学校行事や日々の活動も追いやすく、学校生活の輪郭が見えやすいです。学校紹介、学校生活、行事、進路、部活動の導線がそろっており、入学後の姿を想像しやすい学校です。","clubs":[{"id":4343,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4344,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4346,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/n547bf3c2dc85","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4348,"name":"釣り人同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/n547bf3c2dc85","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13196,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13197,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13198,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13199,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13200,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13201,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13202,"name":"チアリーダー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13203,"name":"アメリカンフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n/na0132fd9c5b0","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13204,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nichidai1-edu.note.jp/n